-     detail
-         Error `↯/s.87.2`: _the query parameter could not be read because the parameter was not
-         present in the query string_. Raised by the `Decodable in Query` givens when a value
-         which is required has no parameter, and focused at that field's `Pointer` when a case
-         class is decoded, so an accruing strategy reports every missing field of a form.
+     detail
+         Erreur `↯/s.87.2` : _the query parameter could not be read because the parameter was not
+         present in the query string_. Levée par les givens `Decodable in Query` quand une valeur
+         requise n'a pas de paramètre, et ciblée sur le `Pointer` de ce champ lors du décodage
+         d'une case class, de sorte qu'une stratégie cumulative signale chaque champ manquant d'un
+         formulaire.

